@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, oracle
+    :tickets: 4064
+
+    Added some additional rules to fully handle ``Decimal('Infinity')``,
+    ``Decimal('-Infinity')`` values with cx_Oracle numerics when using
+    ``asdecimal=True``.
